---
// Bright Bow Branding - Modern Arc Design
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Bright Bow | Premium Branding & Printing</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
</head>
<body style="margin:0; padding:0; font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif; background-color: #ffffff; color: #1a1a1a;">

    <nav style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; padding: 20px 5%; position: fixed; width: 90%; z-index: 100; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.8); backdrop-filter: blur(10px);">
        <div style="font-weight: 800; font-size: 24px; letter-spacing: -1px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;">
            <div style="width: 30px; height: 30px; background: #0047AB; border-radius: 8px 0 8px 8px;"></div>
            BRIGHT BOW
        </div>
        <a href="https://wa.me/254..." style="background: #FF4500; color: white; padding: 12px 24px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 50px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px;">Contact Us</a>
    </nav>

    <section style="min-height: 100vh; display: flex; align-items: center; padding: 0 5%; position: relative; overflow: hidden;">
        <div style="max-width: 800px; z-index: 2;">
            <h1 style="font-size: clamp(50px, 8vw, 100px); font-weight: 800; line-height: 0.9; margin: 0; letter-spacing: -4px;">
                Vivid Identity. <br>
                <span style="color: #0047AB;">Precision</span> Print.
            </h1>
            <p style="margin-top: 30px; font-size: 18px; color: #666; max-width: 500px; line-height: 1.6;">
                We transform business infrastructure into visual landmarks. From Nairobi to the world, we build brands that can't be ignored.
            </p>
            <div style="margin-top: 40px; display: flex; gap: 20px;">
                <div style="width: 60px; height: 60px; background: #FFD700; border-radius: 50%;"></div>
                <div style="width: 60px; height: 60px; background: #E11D48; border-radius: 0 30px 30px 30px;"></div>
                <div style="width: 60px; height: 60px; background: #FF4500; border-radius: 30px 30px 0 30px;"></div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div style="position: absolute; right: -10%; top: 10%; width: 50vw; height: 50vw; background: #f0f7ff; border-radius: 200px 0 200px 200px; z-index: 1; opacity: 0.5;"></div>
    </section>

    <section style="padding: 100px 5%; background: #1a1a1a; color: white;">
        <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr)); gap: 40px;">
            <div style="border-left: 2px solid #0047AB; padding-left: 30px;">
                <h3 style="font-size: 32px; margin-bottom: 15px; color: #0047AB;">01. Branding</h3>
                <p style="color: #aaa; line-height: 1.6;">Architecture of visual identity systems for growing enterprises.</p>
            </div>
            <div style="border-left: 2px solid #FF4500; padding-left: 30px;">
                <h3 style="font-size: 32px; margin-bottom: 15px; color: #FF4500;">02. Printing</h3>
                <p style="color: #aaa; line-height: 1.6;">High-fidelity production and premium material sourcing.</p>
            </div>
            <div style="border-left: 2px solid #E11D48; padding-left: 30px;">
                <h3 style="font-size: 32px; margin-bottom: 15px; color: #E11D48;">03. Strategy</h3>
                <p style="color: #aaa; line-height: 1.6;">Consultancy for brand positioning in competitive markets.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <footer style="padding: 50px 5%; text-align: center; font-weight: 700; color: #ccc; border-top: 1px solid #eee;">
        © 2026 BRIGHT BOW BRANDING & PRINTING
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
